      "created_at": "2017-05-11T02:51:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Ha! US Patent 1 seems pretty cute. It's definitely much more steampunky and linear than my prototype. We hit different time-travel archetypes!</p><p>Just goes to show that for every pair of similar ideas, the concepts can diverge quite substantially. :)</p>",
