      "id": 197932,
      "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
      "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-05-11T13:58:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I've played Kill Doctor Lucky. &nbsp;It's not an amazing game, but it's fun to pull out every once in a while. &nbsp;And the flavor is hilarious.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>(For those unfamiliar, Kill Doctor Lucky is reverse Clue. &nbsp;Rather than investigating who killed the doctor, everybody is competing to be the murderer. &nbsp;Also, Dr. Lucky is terrifingly good at avoiding his death by accident. &nbsp;My gaming group is convinced that he's secretly either an alien or a ninja.)</p>",
      "post_number": 8,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:25:44.929Z",
